WEBVTT

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:11.780
What are you doing?

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.110
Why did you come here?

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:16.440
I'll become king, or whatever it takes!

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.610
How long will you keep digging?

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.530
The Rune's protection is with us!

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.900
As long as the future is peaceful, I don't mind.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:29.530
With the Progenitor Rune's power, she might
be able to defeat even the King of Darkness.

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:32.190
Those who glimpse an ideal

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:36.360
have a duty to devote their lives
to making it a reality!

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.070
How many times does this make?

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:41.980
We managed to repel the darkness's
invasion with difficulty, but...

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:45.860
Who can say how long my power
will work against him.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.030
What's yours, boy?

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:52.030
I'm sure that under the next King of Darkness,
the balance will be preserved once more.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:56.030
I am the Prince of Darkness,
successor to the King of Darkness!

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:17.530
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:31.000
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:34.000
"Chapter 2: The World's Egoism"

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.780
Hurry! Follow Her Majesty!

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:48.940
Yes, sir!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:52.900
Everyone,

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:56.480
a threat has appeared in Metis,
the western capital.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.860
We will hurry there alongside the knights.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:12.570
This way!

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:20.440
Why not put up a little more
resistance? I won't mind.

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:33.570
Oh, so that's where you were hiding.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.780
Everyone, we must not be afraid!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.940
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:48.980
I'll go first this time.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.530
Fire!

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:11.320
Are you that eager to tell me where you are?

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.690
Well then...

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.650
...I'll have to thank you!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.610
Oh?

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:23.980
Bahl!

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.480
I won't let you defile this land any further!

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.320
Lord Alantia!

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:31.110
We'll handle this!

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:33.360
Please lead the people to safety!

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:34.480
Yes, sir!

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:39.690
Alantia, leader of the elves.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:42.320
Try to make this fun.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:43.440
Go!

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:56.030
Knight Commander! There are
soldiers of darkness ahead.

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:56.940
What?!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.480
But we just drove them off.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.190
First troop, follow me!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.690
Second troop, soldiers of darkness are coming!

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:08.030
Don't let them lay a finger on the mages!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.570
Sheama, watch our backs!

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:13.530
Right! Leave it to me.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:15.070
We won't let them get close!

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:16.190
Let's go!

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:35.280
Try not to disappoint me.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.360
Now!

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:45.150
I see you've caught me.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.530
Good job!

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:57.570
Not bad.

00:05:57.570 --> 00:05:58.940
But!

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:04.150
This is bad! Spirits, fall back!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:29.780
A winged ant is still an ant.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.980
I never imagined he could be so powerful.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.110
What am I supposed to do?

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.610
Your Majesty!

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:59.190
Take care.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:02.690
May the Progenitor Rune... protect you.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:10.780
Your Majesty! His power defies belief!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:12.730
Thank you, Alantia.

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:17.610
I'm sure your efforts allowed
some of the people to escape.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:22.400
So, the top contender finally
puts in an appearance.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:23.480
Bahl!

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:27.900
If you remain here any longer,
I will show you no mercy!

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:33.190
Go ahead; I don't mind.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:43.070
My, you're fast.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.730
They must have taken advantage of Bahl's attack.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:58.230
The cowards!

00:07:58.230 --> 00:07:59.610
W-Wait!

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:01.530
We're only deserters!

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.820
We surrender! Help us!

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:05.480
Wh-What?

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:08.110
Then drop your weapons and get on your knees!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:15.440
Have you no pride as warriors?

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:19.070
Of course not. We're not warriors!

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:23.400
We're just peasants conscripted into the war!

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.480
It's the truth!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.030
Please believe u--

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.400
What?!

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.360
So, these are darkness's true colors!

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.070
Attack!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:51.110
There aren't many of them!

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:59.150
Rune, obey my will!

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:03.110
Calida Lux, Puram Lucem!

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:05.480
Begone!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:18.280
What willfully violent power.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.730
At this rate, against Bahl, I...

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:23.690
What are you twittering about?

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:26.360
Entertain me more!

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.860
Dea Preces!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.610
That's the spirit.

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.780
I'd expect no less from the Queen of Light.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:58.190
Still, I barely felt that.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:01.440
I knew it.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:05.610
I need more of the Progenitor Rune's power!

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.480
Rune, obey my will!

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:12.940
Calida Lux, Puram Lucem!

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:16.230
Your Majesty!

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:19.070
If you use that much power...!

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:23.690
Oh?

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:28.070
Do you think you can destroy me
without getting serious?

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:31.530
I can't put any more strain
on the Progenitor Rune.

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:40.230
What a wet blanket.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.400
Bahl?!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.900
Your Majesty?

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:03.480
Give aid to the survivors.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:06.190
Phious will be here shortly.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.530
Yes.

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:09.030
As Your Majesty wishes.

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:25.730
It's an awful sight.

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.360
Sheama.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:30.480
Darkness attacked us on our way.

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:35.400
It looks like my brother routed them,

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:38.030
but they seemed to be human soldiers.

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:40.230
I see.

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:52.030
"No. 02 Spirits"
"A race said to be formed of
materialized Soul. Elves are sometimes
included in the same broad category."

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.400
Dark Knight Vallus!

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.190
Has His Majesty still not returned?

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:03.860
Why do you wish to know?

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.360
There is a matter I wish to
bring to his attention.

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:07.940
What is it?

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:13.570
Only my followers were
sacrificed in this expedition.

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:14.980
Let me speak!

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:18.690
We shouldn't continue these fruitless battles!

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:22.820
The people of Black aren't savages
who do nothing but invade!

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:24.860
Are you listening to me, Vallus?!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.030
Welcome back, Majesty.

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.070
Indeed.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.860
Your Majesty, there was
no need to dirty your hands.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:50.360
If you had but ordered me...

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.320
Th-That's...!

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:05.860
Your Majesty.

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:08.400
Why does the sky exist?

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:11.900
All space will return to
the darkness of oblivion.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:16.320
The cracks that light shines through
are but passing phantoms.

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:18.110
Cover it all in darkness.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:21.480
The earth, the sky, everything.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.530
As Your Majesty wishes.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:27.610
Losing troops, however,
may not be a winning strategy.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:31.980
The people of Black are bound to obey darkness.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:34.530
It is as Your Majesty says.

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:38.570
White in the sky,

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:41.820
Black on the earth.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:45.230
Coexistence is meaningless.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:53.690
We will have rest when darkness
has blotted out all things.

00:13:53.690 --> 00:14:00.110
To achieve that, we must strike down
the foolish sky-dwellers.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.530
But before that...

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.820
The World's Egoism... Bahl.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:12.280
Yes.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:16.730
The next generation no longer serves a purpose.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:24.280
Make yourselves useful, my would-be successors.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.530
Where have you been, Vallus?

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:37.150
I was at the royal palace
with the King of Darkness.

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:38.190
Why?

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:44.400
I serve the King of Darkness...
and his potential successors.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.860
My loyalty to you is certain.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.150
Is that how that works?

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:52.980
I guess it's fine.

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:55.440
Vallus, teach me to use a sword!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:15:00.440
I can't become King of Darkness
if I can't beat you, can I?

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:02.480
That is one concern...

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:08.440
...but those who would be king
must also be well-versed in learning.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:12.780
Huh? What for?

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:16.360
It is necessary to govern a kingdom.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:21.320
Without knowledge, one cannot properly
cultivate even a single grain of wheat.

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:24.900
Don't tell me you intend to
let the people of Black starve.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.110
Of course not, but I wanna get strong and--

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:31.440
And unless you improve your speech,

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:36.860
you could not maintain your dignity
even if you did become king.

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:40.110
Skeers said that, too.

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:42.900
Shall we also begin your
swordsmanship lessons tomorrow?

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:44.360
You mean it?!

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.900
I would appreciate it, Vallus.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:54.730
You are not the only one
who seeks to become king.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:59.610
I instruct the kingdom's soldiers
in swordsmanship.

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:03.480
Including other potential successors.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:35.650
That was a fluke! One more time!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:42.820
You've grown somewhat stronger
since you first arrived.

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:46.030
But I'm still no match for you.

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.360
I've got to get stronger.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.360
My lord, this way.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:59.230
Lord Skeers wore these in his youth.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:03.150
I believe that they would fit you nicely now.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:04.150
These?

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:04.980
Yes.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:10.030
I'm sure Lord Skeers would be pleased
if you made use of them.

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:25.940
Lady Groza?

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.360
I'm tired.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.980
A-All halt!

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.280
We'll rest here!

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:31.690
Yes, sir!

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:41.070
Honestly, why do I have to come out here
to the middle of nowhere?!

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:43.480
A-An excellent question, ma'am.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:45.070
It's such a bother!

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:49.610
What's a potential successor
to the throne doing out here?!

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:52.900
They can't even be worthy of the name!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:56.360
M-Maybe you shouldn't say that so loud, ma'am.

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:58.070
Who's going to hear?!

00:17:58.070 --> 00:17:59.860
There's nothing out here.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.570
Lady Groza, monsters!

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:06.070
Please stand back!

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:07.070
Huh?

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:11.690
Ha. As if I have anything to fear

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:15.780
from rampaging monsters that don't
even remember who their master is!

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.320
Burn to ashes!

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:25.190
Révolte Éclair!

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:34.820
W-Wow!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:37.230
That's the Gray-Green Demoness for you!

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:39.230
Hey, Princess of Black!

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.400
Hey, Lady Groza!

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:42.730
You're exaggerating.

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:45.070
Stray monsters like those--

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:47.610
Huh?!

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:49.030
Oh no!

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:51.280
I won't have time to attack!

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:03.650
Are you all right?

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.860
Y-Yes, I'm fine.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:11.690
Thank you very much.

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:13.030
I'm glad.

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:20.530
E-Excuse me!

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.980
Wh-Who are you?

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:29.150
Someone aiming to be the next King of Darkness.

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:31.070
The King of Darkness?

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:35.480
Th-Th-Then, umm, so...

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:40.320
...why are you out in the middle of nowhere,
so far from the Kingdom of Black?

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:41.980
It's not that far.

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:42.820
Huh?

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:46.980
I always practice swordsmanship
with Vallus out here.

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:47.980
What?!

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:49.530
O-Oh, yes.

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:52.440
This isn't far from the kingdom at all.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:53.980
Why don't you say anything?!

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:54.940
Huh?

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.570
Anyway, I'm glad you're all right.

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:58.650
Goodbye.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:13.610
The Prince... of Darkness.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.610
Lady Groza.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:17.820
Lady Groza!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.480
You need to say something!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.400
He's going to leave!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.690
Lady Groza?

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:24.230
Lady Groza!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.730
Would you be quiet!

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:28.400
I know that!

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.030
Please wait!

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:35.320
We were looking for you.

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:40.230
Is that so?

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:41.320
Yes.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:45.860
I would like you to compete
with the other candidates.

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:47.820
All right.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.690
Thank you very much.

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:53.530
Also, if you become the number one
candidate for the succession,

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:55.980
you will be awarded the Greatsword of Black.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:21:00.940
You will then be recognized as
the genuine Prince of Darkness.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.070
Still...

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:10.440
Do you have a special attachment to that sword?

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:25.530
So, the Greatsword of Black...

00:22:56.440 --> 00:22:59.780
I see. Darkness sent human soldiers.

00:22:59.780 --> 00:23:04.570
They behaved strangely at one point,
but we cut them all down.

00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:11.820
Still, smiting those who disturb the balance
is the duty of the Knights of Light.

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:14.730
You performed your duty admirably.

00:23:14.730 --> 00:23:16.400
Your Majesty...!

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:24.150
Black and White...

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:28.190
Perhaps we really do feel differently.

00:23:43.820 --> 00:23:46.980
"Next Time"
"Chapter 3: The Grief-stricken Queen of Light"
